  "title": "Connie&#39;s Sweet and Sour Christmas Meatballs",
  "description": "Simple beef meatballs simmered in a tangy brown sugar, vinegar, and ketchup sauce make a tasty appetizer or main dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Catherine Parnell-Proulx"
  ],
